# Build context is the repository root for every Dockerfile (docs/IMPLEMENTATION_SPEC.md section 0).
# Keep: backend/, inference/, frontend/ sources, config/, contracts/, tests/ (test targets copy them).
# Never send: VCS data, secrets, model weights, data/artifacts, local environments, generated output.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
.env*
secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Model weights and data (weights are downloaded and verified by model-init, never baked into images)
models/
model/
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.engine
data/
uploads/
datasets/
artifacts/
backups/
runs/
mlruns/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
# Downloaded licensed test media are mounted at test time, not copied into images
tests/fixtures/cache/

# Local environments, caches and build output
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
frontend/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/coverage

# Handoff kit, deployment state and docs not needed in images
DreamDrive_Claude_Kit/
deploy/state/
*(1).md
